---
source: crates/pgt-ddl/src/build/acl.rs
expression: render(&p)
---
[Destructive] REVOKE INSERT ON TABLE s.t FROM PUBLIC
[Destructive] REVOKE UPDATE ON TABLE s.t FROM b
[Destructive] REVOKE GRANT OPTION FOR SELECT ON TABLE s.t FROM b
[Destructive] REVOKE SELECT, TRIGGER ON TABLE s.t FROM gone
[Safe] GRANT TRUNCATE ON TABLE s.t TO PUBLIC
[Safe] GRANT SELECT ON TABLE s.t TO "Yeni"
[Safe] GRANT INSERT ON TABLE s.t TO a
[Safe] GRANT DELETE ON TABLE s.t TO a WITH GRANT OPTION
[Safe] GRANT REFERENCES ON TABLE s.t TO b WITH GRANT OPTION
